WEBVTT

00:36.920 --> 00:38.320
Brother-in-law

01:05.520 --> 01:06.360
Brother

01:06.440 --> 01:07.400
Yiyang has fallen

01:07.480 --> 01:08.680
Those troops from Wuyang

01:08.840 --> 01:09.520
Watched from afar

01:09.600 --> 01:11.360
The command flag on the tower was replaced

01:11.440 --> 01:12.840
And have withdrawn

01:14.160 --> 01:16.800
There was a female general who charged into the city

01:16.880 --> 01:18.280
But has been captured

01:18.520 --> 01:19.600
I see

01:19.680 --> 01:22.160
She's a top-class fiery steed

01:22.880 --> 01:24.320
Clean her up for me

01:24.400 --> 01:26.080
After I kill these two sheep

01:26.160 --> 01:27.120
I'll go see

01:27.200 --> 01:28.600
Good
